@fact tamsin.thornwick
# en: An illusion student at Thornwick, in your year, who writes to you.
text [c2878b] = 荆木学院幻术专业的学生，与你同年级，一直给你写信。

@fact tamsin.theatre
# en: Their grandmother runs a travelling theatre; they learned illusion painting her backdrops.
text [93eb25] = TA 的祖母经营一个巡回剧团；TA 是在给她画布景时学会幻术的。
# en: Keep writing back.
hint [c47e9f] = 继续给他们回信。

@fact tamsin.assigned
# en: Thornwick told them to write to a Lumenhold student and report back. They stopped reporting by the third letter.
text [3ef61a] = 荆木学院让 TA 写信给一名流明堡学生，并回去汇报。到第三封信时，TA 就不再汇报了。
# en: Ask why they wrote to you in the first place.
hint [da8702] = 问问他们当初为什么给你写信。

@fact tamsin.pie
# en: Their roommate bet them a pie that you'd never write back. They won the pie.
text [490b59] = TA的室友跟TA打赌，说你永远不会回信。TA赢了一个馅饼。
# en: Answer their second letter.
hint [135c4f] = 回TA的第二封信。

@fact tamsin.sketches
# en: They fill their letters with sketches of Thornwick's professors in the margins. Their illusion professor is usually a goat.
text [6306eb] = TA在信的页边画满了荆木教授们的速写。TA的幻术教授通常是一只山羊。
# en: Let them tell you the Thornwick gossip.
hint [85e3d5] = 让TA讲讲荆木的八卦。

@fact tamsin.failed
# en: They once failed their illusion examination, the one thing they were good at, in the same term their grandmother's theatre was sold.
text [8405fc] = TA曾经在幻术考试中失利，那是TA唯一擅长的东西，而就在同一个学期，TA祖母的剧团被卖掉了。
# en: Read the short letter.
hint [3743b2] = 读那封很短的信。
